# Codebase context (SnapletApp)
Android app with Kotlin + Jetpack Compose + Hilt. Main flow: `ApiService` -> `RepositoryImpl` (`safeApiCall`) -> `UseCase`/`ViewModel` (`StateFlow`) -> Composable.
**Rule:** Infer impacted area(s) from the prompt and read only those folders plus direct dependencies. Do not read the whole codebase.

