## Practical routing hints

- Prompt mentions **friend search/result action/accept/remove friend** -> start at `domain/relationship/`, then `data/repository/UserRepository(Impl)` and `ui/screens/home/components/FriendBottomSheet.kt`.
- Prompt mentions **reactions/unread/new posts** -> start at `data/repository/post/`, `domain/feed/`, `ui/screens/home/` and related components.
- Prompt mentions **token/session/logout** -> inspect `data/repository/auth/`, `network/`, `data/datasource/local/datastore/`.
- Prompt mentions **widget** -> inspect both `ui/widget/` and `platform/widget/`, plus `di/WorkManagerModule.kt`.
- Prompt mentions **notification/FCM** -> inspect `platform/notification/`, `domain/notification/`, `data/repository/UserRepository(Impl)`, and `AndroidManifest.xml`.
- Prompt mentions **deeplink to spotlight post** -> inspect `platform/deeplink/`, `navigation/NavScreen.kt`, `navigation/NavGraph.kt`, and `ui/screens/spotlight_post/`.
- Prompt mentions **Crashlytics/release logging** -> inspect `HiltApplication.kt`, `utils/CrashlyticsLogger.kt`, and Gradle Firebase dependencies/config.